# Testing rules

- Every story's tests in its milestone file are written with the code, not after.
- Kernel tests use a scratch Postgres via `backend/tests/_pg.py`, the fake model and the in-process MCP mocks. No test
  calls a real model or the network.
- Failure paths use the connectors' fault switches and a frozen clock, not sleeps.
- Contract tests (`test_contracts.py`) must stay green; when the spec changes, update examples in
  `docs/specs/contracts/examples/` too.
- Playwright specs are named after the walkthrough stop they prove (`e2e/stop-07-rfq-approval.spec.ts`).
